{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108222","id":2636662085,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6dKEVF","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108222","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108222.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108222.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108222","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108222/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108222/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108222/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/af5366da8a0a148aa79127a6c03a8471722003f7","number":108222,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"libjpeg-turbo: Update to 3.1.1","user":{"login":"Chubercik","id":37378746,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3Mzc4NzQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37378746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik","html_url":"https://github.com/Chubercik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"https://github.com/libjpeg-turbo/libjpeg-turbo/releases/tag/3.1.1\r\n\r\n**Significant changes relative to 3.1.0**:\r\n\r\n1. Hardened the libjpeg API against hypothetical calling applications that may erroneously change the value of the `data_precision` field in `jpeg_compress_struct` or `jpeg_decompress_struct` after calling `jpeg_start_compress()` or `jpeg_start_decompress()`.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe update process for this library needs to be updated to eliminate any and all guesswork: there isn't a single mention of any config files that need to be included, even though there are three of them:\r\n\r\n- `jconfig.h` (from `jconfig.h.in`)\r\n- `jconfigint.h` (from `jconfigint.h.in`)\r\n- `jversion.h` (from `jversion.h.in`)\r\n\r\nI'm assuming the `0001-cmake-generated-headers.patch` patch was supposed to create them in their entirety, but I find that a little confusing; I changed it so that the user is required to rename template files `jconfig.h.in`, `jconfigint.h.in`, `jversion.h.in` by removing the `.in` suffix and then applying the patch onto them (less deviation from source). This still requires manual work every update to ensure proper constant defines (e.g. `LIBJPEG_TURBO_VERSION`).\r\n\r\nAm I missing something? Is this change welcome? If so, should I describe it somewhere in the `thirdparty`'s `README.md` file?\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null